  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to sustainably improve the living conditions of poor rural households and their resilience to climate change. The development objective is to improve sustainable access by rural households to water and rangeland resources and their resilience to climate change, food and nutrition security and income, especially for women and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
